eted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono \n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint 21 (Vanessa) - X11 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti - AMD FX(tm)-9590 Eight-Core Processor (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\neditorInterface.ReloadSceneFromPath(pathToTscn); from script does not reload the scene in the editor as manually clicking Scene - Reload Saved Scene does.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse provided mrp:\r\n\r\nTo use it build from source, then enable the addon in Project Settings - Plugins. Then open the Scene1 in the Scenes folder.  \r\nWhen you press the button in the addons panel the root node in the open scene is renamed by replacing the root nodes name in the tscn file. The change only shows when Scene - Reload Saved Scene is pressed, the tab is closed and the tscn reopened or if Godot notices that the file has changed and opens the dialog to keep or overwrite the scene file.  \r\n\r\nIf you want to redo the action unpack and overwrite the Scene1 from the Scene1.tscn bkp.zip archive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reloadscenemrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17749618/reloadscenemrp.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BrahRah","id":40721994,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzIxOTk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40721994?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah","html_url":"https://github.com/BrahRah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrahRah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.git